1
00:00:48,440 --> 00:00:50,360
How much do you usually make per order?

2
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,240
Three to five yuan.

3
00:00:51,240 --> 00:00:53,700
That's so little.
How is it even profitable?

4
00:00:56,560 --> 00:00:58,480
Bring two bottles
of Jingyi electrolyte water,

5
00:00:58,480 --> 00:00:59,720
or I'll leave a bad review.

6
00:00:59,720 --> 00:01:00,720
What's wrong with them?

7
00:01:00,720 --> 00:01:02,280
Paying for one and demanding two services.

8
00:01:02,280 --> 00:01:03,240
Why?

9
00:01:03,560 --> 00:01:04,489
Wait for me a sec.

10
00:01:11,200 --> 00:01:12,520
You're actually bringing it to him?

11
00:01:12,520 --> 00:01:14,250
A bad review means a deduction.

12
00:01:20,360 --> 00:01:22,090
It's cold. Quench your thirst.

13
00:01:23,680 --> 00:01:24,840
You're so soft.

14
00:01:24,840 --> 00:01:26,700
No wonder you always get bullied.

15
00:01:26,800 --> 00:01:27,530
I'm leaving.

16
00:01:44,360 --> 00:01:45,280
Slow down.

17
00:01:45,520 --> 00:01:47,250
I can't. It's almost overtime.

18
00:01:52,680 --> 00:01:53,479
Wait for me here.

19
00:01:53,479 --> 00:01:54,539
I'll be right down.

20
00:01:58,360 --> 00:01:59,039
Hello,

21
00:01:59,479 --> 00:02:00,240
I'm downstairs.

22
00:02:00,240 --> 00:02:00,800
I'll be right up.

23
00:02:00,800 --> 00:02:01,680
Wait for me a moment.

24
00:02:01,680 --> 00:02:03,010
Wait, don't come up yet.

25
00:02:03,360 --> 00:02:04,120
What's wrong?

26
00:02:04,120 --> 00:02:05,120
I bought the on-time guarantee.

27
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,760
It'll be overtime in two minutes.

28
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,820
I can get the money once the time is up.

29
00:02:08,840 --> 00:02:10,639
Don't click delivered right now.

30
00:02:10,639 --> 00:02:12,200
If you click it early,
I'll complain about you.

31
00:02:12,200 --> 00:02:13,480
We're not delivering your order.

32
00:02:13,480 --> 00:02:14,880
I'll refund you double.

33
00:02:16,400 --> 00:02:17,920
I don't think this is a good idea.

34
00:02:17,920 --> 00:02:19,000
We're gonna get reported.

35
00:02:19,000 --> 00:02:20,280
He looks pretty broke to me.

36
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:22,340
Let him skip a meal to save some money.

37
00:02:22,640 --> 00:02:23,840
Besides, I'm hungry.

38
00:02:24,800 --> 00:02:26,130
Let's go eat over there.

39
00:02:27,360 --> 00:02:29,490
It's dirty here. Let's go back and eat.

40
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:32,360
I think it's fine. Let's go.

41
00:02:43,320 --> 00:02:46,450
Hope you don't mind
there's only one pair of chopsticks.

42
00:02:47,079 --> 00:02:47,880
It's fine.

43
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:50,840
Alright.

44
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:52,280
You try one first.

45
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:04,800
Have a taste.

46
00:03:12,240 --> 00:03:13,360
Is it too spicy?

47
00:03:14,080 --> 00:03:15,520
Quick, take a sip.

48
00:03:20,040 --> 00:03:21,240
Much better.

49
00:03:22,960 --> 00:03:25,360
You work so hard
delivering food every day.

50
00:03:25,520 --> 00:03:27,120
Where does all your money go?

51
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,720
I have a bottomless pit to fill.

52
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,040
A bottomless pit?

53
00:03:31,880 --> 00:03:34,010
Then you should consider me even more.

54
00:03:34,240 --> 00:03:36,160
What if I can fill it for you?

55
00:03:38,800 --> 00:03:42,040
Human greed can never be satisfied.

56
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:44,360
Thank goodness

57
00:03:44,360 --> 00:03:45,890
those people finally left.

58
00:03:45,920 --> 00:03:47,360
Thanks to you guys this time,

59
00:03:47,360 --> 00:03:49,160
or I would've lost half my life.

60
00:03:49,960 --> 00:03:51,520
But you didn't see it.

61
00:03:51,600 --> 00:03:53,520
Hu was so cool at the end.

62
00:03:53,760 --> 00:03:55,079
It was like she became
a totally different person.

63
00:03:55,079 --> 00:03:56,079
Super badass.

64
00:03:57,400 --> 00:03:57,880
I don't know

65
00:03:57,880 --> 00:03:59,640
how she suddenly figured it out.

66
00:03:59,640 --> 00:04:01,970
It's like she unlocked her full potential

67
00:04:02,640 --> 00:04:03,770
and just leveled up.

68
00:04:05,160 --> 00:04:06,280
Anyway,

69
00:04:06,320 --> 00:04:07,560
it's a good thing.

70
00:04:08,280 --> 00:04:09,240
I wonder when

71
00:04:09,240 --> 00:04:11,520
I'll find the catalyst to level up.

72
00:04:14,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Isn't Yunbianshang your catalyst?

73
00:04:21,519 --> 00:04:22,320
Let's go eat.

74
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,440
Time to eat!

75
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:32,740
Look, the sunset is so beautiful.

76
00:04:35,200 --> 00:04:36,159
It's okay.

77
00:04:36,560 --> 00:04:37,960
Everything will be fine.

78
00:04:44,240 --> 00:04:45,080
Eat some more.

79
00:04:47,440 --> 00:04:48,240
Smells great.

80
00:04:51,920 --> 00:04:52,520
Here.

81
00:04:57,920 --> 00:04:59,780
The sunset is so beautiful today.

82
00:05:21,920 --> 00:05:23,440
Miss, try some peaches.

83
00:05:23,440 --> 00:05:24,880
No, thanks.

84
00:05:24,880 --> 00:05:26,520
And tangerines. Yongquan tangerines,

85
00:05:26,520 --> 00:05:27,720
10 yuan for three jin.

86
00:05:30,760 --> 00:05:32,120
Fireworks of life,

87
00:05:35,520 --> 00:05:37,480
the ultimate romance.

88
00:05:44,159 --> 00:05:45,080
Hiring.

89
00:05:51,720 --> 00:05:52,520
Here is yours.

90
00:05:52,520 --> 00:05:53,240
Thank you.

91
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,520
Have fun.

92
00:05:56,840 --> 00:05:57,800
Hope you enjoy your stay.

93
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:59,320
Okay. Thanks, pretty.

94
00:05:59,640 --> 00:06:01,480
It's right there. Turn left ahead.

95
00:06:01,480 --> 00:06:02,560
Okay. Thanks.

96
00:06:03,880 --> 00:06:05,240
Hello. Sorry to keep you waiting.

97
00:06:05,240 --> 00:06:06,500
Please show me your ID.

98
00:06:07,280 --> 00:06:08,880
I'm not here for a room.

99
00:06:09,120 --> 00:06:11,440
I'm here to apply for the cleaner job.

100
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:21,640
I want to keep the sound of the sea,

101
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:24,500
plant flowers
on the south-facing windowsill,

102
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:27,600
and wait for the moment
the breeze brushes my hair.

103
00:06:27,600 --> 00:06:30,760
From now on,
I don't have to be strong anymore,

104
00:06:30,800 --> 00:06:33,640
because my Qiang is here.

105
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:38,080
Your Qiang?

106
00:06:38,240 --> 00:06:39,280
That's my husband,

107
00:06:39,280 --> 00:06:40,560
my dear Qiang.

108
00:06:41,200 --> 00:06:42,040
I came here

109
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,040
to record

110
00:06:43,040 --> 00:06:44,680
the love story between me and my Qiang.

111
00:06:44,680 --> 00:06:46,600
Working while creating,

112
00:06:46,600 --> 00:06:48,640
living in Xinchang for a while.

113
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:50,240
My dear Qiang and I

114
00:06:50,240 --> 00:06:51,159
are childhood sweethearts.

115
00:06:51,159 --> 00:06:53,090
Aunt Qian is not only a modern poet,

116
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:54,440
but also a hopeless romantic.

117
00:06:54,440 --> 00:06:56,040
Qiang had always had

118
00:06:56,040 --> 00:06:57,240
a secret crush on me.

119
00:06:57,240 --> 00:06:59,200
Although I married someone else later,

120
00:06:59,200 --> 00:07:01,480
Qiang never let go of his love for me.

121
00:07:01,640 --> 00:07:03,440
He still silently protected me.

122
00:07:03,440 --> 00:07:05,000
Later, by a twist of fate,

123
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:06,440
I divorced my ex-husband.

124
00:07:06,440 --> 00:07:08,480
Qiang finally couldn't hold back his love

125
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,680
and confessed to me.

126
00:07:09,880 --> 00:07:12,080
I was instantly moved
by his deep affection.

127
00:07:12,080 --> 00:07:13,760
We hit it off right away,

128
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:15,760
and lovers finally got married.

129
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:20,760
Aunt Qian, you are so lucky.

130
00:07:21,080 --> 00:07:22,640
Your husband loves you so much.

131
00:07:22,640 --> 00:07:25,920
Yes. After we got married,
Qiang spoiled me even more.

132
00:07:25,920 --> 00:07:27,520
He calls me his sweet baby all the time,

133
00:07:27,520 --> 00:07:28,960
and doesn't let me do any chores.

134
00:07:28,960 --> 00:07:31,560
Now I'm obsessed with
creating and traveling.

135
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:33,560
He told me not to worry
about things at home.

136
00:07:33,560 --> 00:07:36,720
He said being his woman
means enjoying life.

137
00:07:38,640 --> 00:07:39,840
She seems a bit unreliable.

138
00:07:39,840 --> 00:07:41,120
Maybe we should keep looking.

139
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:42,720
But we have a lot of customers right now,

140
00:07:42,720 --> 00:07:44,520
and we're really short-handed.

141
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:50,159
Since you're applying
for the cleaner position,

142
00:07:50,159 --> 00:07:51,880
how about a practical test?

143
00:07:52,560 --> 00:07:53,480
Sure, sure!

144
00:07:57,159 --> 00:07:57,960
This is it.

145
00:08:04,040 --> 00:08:06,000
This room was just checked out.

146
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:07,920
Please clean it up as fast as you can.

147
00:08:07,920 --> 00:08:09,450
We need to test your skills.

148
00:08:09,480 --> 00:08:10,120
Okay.

149
00:08:20,160 --> 00:08:22,840
She's twice as fast as me.

150
00:08:23,400 --> 00:08:24,320
But didn't she say

151
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:26,520
Qiang doesn't let her do chores at home?

152
00:08:26,720 --> 00:08:28,320
How is she so skilled at this?

153
00:08:28,360 --> 00:08:31,160
Maybe she got used to it
at her ex-husband's.

154
00:08:31,160 --> 00:08:31,920
It doesn't matter.

155
00:08:31,920 --> 00:08:32,919
As long as she's capable,

156
00:08:32,919 --> 00:08:33,919
we'll hire her.

157
00:08:41,520 --> 00:08:43,080
What do you think, ladies?

158
00:08:43,080 --> 00:08:44,360
Your skills meet our standards.

159
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:45,820
We've decided to hire you.

160
00:08:45,840 --> 00:08:48,240
You can call me the manager or Qingqing.

161
00:08:48,240 --> 00:08:49,680
Okay, Ms. Qingqing.

162
00:08:57,920 --> 00:08:58,720
How is it?

163
00:08:59,800 --> 00:09:02,120
I've been so busy lately.

164
00:09:02,720 --> 00:09:03,520
It's been so long

165
00:09:03,520 --> 00:09:04,880
since I had such a great home-cooked meal.

166
00:09:04,880 --> 00:09:06,520
You really are my lifesaver.

167
00:09:06,720 --> 00:09:07,920
Look at you, you've lost weight.

168
00:09:07,920 --> 00:09:09,240
You must be exhausted lately.

169
00:09:09,240 --> 00:09:11,700
I'm fine.
It's just been these past few days.

170
00:09:11,800 --> 00:09:13,730
If business keeps being this good,

171
00:09:14,080 --> 00:09:15,960
I might be able to pay off Tangtang's debt

172
00:09:15,960 --> 00:09:17,440
before she even gets back.

173
00:09:18,320 --> 00:09:19,180
Have some more.

174
00:09:20,000 --> 00:09:20,800
Thanks.

175
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,960
Do you want to go
to the fireworks festival?

176
00:09:25,480 --> 00:09:28,000
There will be a night market that evening.

177
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,640
We can stroll around.

178
00:09:30,160 --> 00:09:30,960
And...

179
00:09:33,880 --> 00:09:34,680
And what?

180
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:37,760
I also hid puzzle pieces

181
00:09:37,760 --> 00:09:39,040
at different stalls.

182
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,440
We can look for them while we walk around.

183
00:09:41,440 --> 00:09:44,560
Isn't that just like a treasure hunt?

184
00:09:45,680 --> 00:09:47,240
Wow, you really know how to have fun.

185
00:09:47,240 --> 00:09:48,080
You bet.

186
00:09:48,480 --> 00:09:50,480
Here's some water for you two.

187
00:09:51,880 --> 00:09:53,080
Let me introduce you.

188
00:09:53,640 --> 00:09:56,840
This is my new cleaner, Ms. Qian.

189
00:09:57,080 --> 00:09:58,480
This is my friend, Shen Feng.

190
00:09:58,480 --> 00:10:00,920
Seeing you two so sweet
and perfect for each other

191
00:10:00,920 --> 00:10:02,440
reminds me of

192
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:04,240
when I reunited with Qiang.

193
00:10:04,240 --> 00:10:05,600
At that time, my boss said

194
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,600
he wanted to set me up on a blind date.

195
00:10:07,600 --> 00:10:09,680
So I picked out a beautiful dress,

196
00:10:09,880 --> 00:10:11,880
got a cute wavy perm,

197
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,880
and painted my nails light pink.

198
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:15,760
Who knew that when I got there,

199
00:10:16,360 --> 00:10:19,320
it turned out to be
my childhood sweetheart, Qiang!

200
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,080
When Qiang saw me,

201
00:10:21,080 --> 00:10:23,160
he kept praising me
for being shy and cute.

202
00:10:23,160 --> 00:10:25,840
He also took me to the beach
to watch the fireworks.

203
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,900
The fireworks went bang, bang, bang!

204
00:10:28,400 --> 00:10:29,800
They were so loud.

205
00:10:29,800 --> 00:10:31,760
My heart was pounding so fast.

206
00:10:32,720 --> 00:10:34,880
Qiang hugged me,

207
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,040
covered my ears,
and told me not to be afraid

208
00:10:37,040 --> 00:10:38,680
because he was there.

209
00:10:41,280 --> 00:10:42,400
Will you be scared?

210
00:10:42,400 --> 00:10:44,160
How about I hold you

211
00:10:44,320 --> 00:10:45,650
and cover your ears too?

212
00:10:47,520 --> 00:10:48,480
You're kidding.

213
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:51,920
I was blowing up fish with firecrackers
when I was four or five.

214
00:10:51,920 --> 00:10:53,160
Can you picture that?

215
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,800
If you're scared,

216
00:10:55,800 --> 00:10:58,240
you can hide in my broad embrace.

217
00:10:59,080 --> 00:10:59,680
Okay,

218
00:10:59,920 --> 00:11:02,360
then I'll see you at the fireworks show.

219
00:11:03,880 --> 00:11:04,760
It's a deal.

220
00:11:04,880 --> 00:11:06,010
I'll get going then.

221
00:11:06,840 --> 00:11:08,040
Bye. Bye.

222
00:11:11,480 --> 00:11:12,520
Ms. Qingqing,

223
00:11:12,680 --> 00:11:14,840
do you like Mr. Shen?

224
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:16,920
No way, Aunt Qian.

225
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:18,160
We're just ordinary friends.

226
00:11:18,160 --> 00:11:19,800
What ordinary friends?

227
00:11:19,800 --> 00:11:21,680
I have eyes, I can see it.

228
00:11:21,800 --> 00:11:23,080
You like him,

229
00:11:23,200 --> 00:11:24,640
and he likes you.

230
00:11:24,880 --> 00:11:26,120
Let me tell you,

231
00:11:26,560 --> 00:11:28,960
never act tough in front of a man.

232
00:11:29,400 --> 00:11:31,680
Men like delicate girls.

233
00:11:32,040 --> 00:11:35,300
What you just said
about blowing up fish with firecrackers

234
00:11:35,480 --> 00:11:37,040
doesn't appeal to guys.

235
00:11:37,120 --> 00:11:38,640
Don't look at how organized

236
00:11:38,640 --> 00:11:39,680
I am now.

237
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:41,720
But in front of Qiang...

238
00:11:42,000 --> 00:11:44,880
I'm just a delicate little flower.

239
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,440
I can't carry or lift anything.

240
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,780
He even has to open bottle caps for me.

241
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:50,920
Qiang said

242
00:11:51,320 --> 00:11:53,000
he just likes me looking

243
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,160
so weak and helpless.

244
00:11:58,680 --> 00:11:59,810
I need to take a call.

245
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,240
Okay, okay.

246
00:12:02,240 --> 00:12:03,370
I'll be right there.

247
00:12:03,520 --> 00:12:05,400
Ms. Qian, I need to go
take care of something.

248
00:12:05,400 --> 00:12:06,240
Sorry.

249
00:12:06,800 --> 00:12:08,160
Have some more.

250
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:15,080
You're so thoughtful.

251
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,640
You even prepared a Hanfu for me.

252
00:12:16,640 --> 00:12:18,170
I've never worn one before.

253
00:12:18,440 --> 00:12:20,160
Many people wear this
to the fireworks festival.

254
00:12:20,160 --> 00:12:21,690
I figured you'd like it too.

255
00:12:22,000 --> 00:12:23,120
You know me so well.

256
00:12:24,600 --> 00:12:25,640
How do I tie this?

257
00:12:36,760 --> 00:12:37,400
All done.

258
00:12:47,120 --> 00:12:47,680
Come,

259
00:12:52,080 --> 00:12:52,610
this way.

260
00:13:07,120 --> 00:13:07,920
Looks great.

261
00:13:09,560 --> 00:13:11,560
How do you know how to do everything?

262
00:13:11,800 --> 00:13:13,530
It's not too late to fall for me.

263
00:13:13,680 --> 00:13:16,280
I'll give you a chance to like me.

264
00:13:17,600 --> 00:13:19,960
Why are you so flirty lately?

265
00:13:20,400 --> 00:13:21,800
Are you trying to bait me?

266
00:13:21,880 --> 00:13:24,140
What's the point of baiting a blockhead?

267
00:13:24,760 --> 00:13:25,680
But it's fine.

268
00:13:26,480 --> 00:13:30,080
At least you're a cute blockhead.

269
00:13:30,320 --> 00:13:31,240
You bet.

270
00:13:31,240 --> 00:13:32,760
I'm a walking clothes hanger.
